    "text": "kjluradio.com\nwebsite\nSaline County, Missouri\nKansas City man sentenced to six years in prison for Saline County police chase in April\nBy Leslie Taylor,\n1 days agoA Kansas City man who led Saline County deputies on a high-speed chase earlier this year is sentenced to prison. Everett Farr, 20, pleaded guilty Monday to eight of the eleven charges against him, including unlawful use of a weapon, resisting arrest, possessing a stolen weapon, driving in a careless and imprudent manner, and DWI.\n31",
